# /apps/ @owner1
# /apps/github

# In this example, @owner1 owns any file in the `/apps`
# directory in the root of your repository except for the `/apps/github`
# subdirectory, as this subdirectory has its own owner @owner2
# Example:
# /apps/ @owner1
# /apps/github @owner2

